\toprule
Learner & Specification\\
\midrule
LSTM & One recurrent layer, 64 hidden units; dense head with 64 units and ReLU; head dropout 0.1; Adam, learning rate 0.001; 150 epochs; batch size 16.\\
LightGBM & Squared-error objective; 800 boosting rounds; 31 leaves; minimum 10 observations per leaf; learning rate 0.05; feature fraction 0.9; bagging fraction 0.8 every round.\\
